Bug 2064058 - Ensure OAuth2 connect attempts finish before providing IMAP threads with tokens. r=babolivier

Seems this is revealing a real problem.
Similar to my fix in bug 2042290.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320126


diff --git a/mailnews/imap/src/nsSyncRunnableHelpers.cpp b/mailnews/imap/src/nsSyncRunnableHelpers.cpp
--- a/mailnews/imap/src/nsSyncRunnableHelpers.cpp
+++ b/mailnews/imap/src/nsSyncRunnableHelpers.cpp
@@ -476,17 +476,20 @@ NS_IMETHODIMP ImapServerSinkProxy::RunLo
